<title>USA: Ampco sets year end div, raises quarterly div.</title>
<headline>Ampco sets year end div, raises quarterly div.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampco-Pittsburgh Corp said on Tuesday directors declared a special year-end dividend of $0.10 a share, and increased its quarterly payout to $0.06 a share from $0.025.</p>
<p>Both dividends are payable January 31 to shareholders of record on January 17, the company said.</p>
<p>It said the board also &quot;expessed its intention to discontinue additional year end dividends after this payment.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
